Package: aidriven-netdefense
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: PT-dove <pt-dove@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: adduser, libc6 (>= 2.28), libstdc++6
Recommends: systemd, openssl
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/ptdove-jiuzi/AIDriven-NetDefense
Description: security monitoring daemon for AIDriven NetDefense (网域智防)
 AIDriven NetDefense collects local security telemetry, evaluates it against a
 bundled detection rule pack, and exposes a loopback-only HTTP API used by the
 console and by the optional model broker. No traffic leaves the host unless a
 model provider is configured explicitly by the administrator.
 .
 This package installs the daemon, the bundled Node.js runtime it runs on, the
 default configuration in /etc/aidriven-netdefense, the writable data tree in
 /var/lib/aidriven-netdefense and a hardened systemd unit. The service runs as
 the unprivileged system user "aegis".
 .
 The package is unsigned. Verify the sha256 published with the release before
 installing; the hash proves the download was not altered, not who built it.
